{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOF (Fear of Failure)</strong> is a physics-based precision platformer where every shot counts. Use the powerful recoil of your shotgun to propel yourself through challenging environments, overcoming obstacles with skill and strategy. Balance on the edge of success \u2014 one wrong move, one moment of fear, and you\u2019ll experience spectacular failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum, defy gravity, and embrace the challenge. Are you ready to face your Fear of Failure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entire game revolves around mastering momentum. Take full advantage of your environment and your shotgun\u2019s powerful recoil to navigate through challenging levels. Use walls, obstacles, and strategic positioning to propel yourself forward \u2014 every shot is an opportunity to climb higher or fall deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision, timing, and creativity are your only allies in the pursuit of success\u2026 or inevitable failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/f03494afbb4b27015a57addcddb56094.poster.avif?t=1759751379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/f03494afbb4b27015a57addcddb56094.webm?t=1759751379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/f03494afbb4b27015a57addcddb56094.mp4?t=1759751379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot matters in <strong>FOF (Fear of Failure)</strong>. Precisely time and aim your shotgun blasts to use recoil as your primary means of movement. One well-calculated shot can launch you toward success, while a single mistake could send you plummeting into spectacular failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the environment, master your momentum, and overcome every obstacle\u2026 if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/aaace3109e8ee0976b93e688c33604b7.poster.avif?t=1759751379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/aaace3109e8ee0976b93e688c33604b7.webm?t=1759751379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/aaace3109e8ee0976b93e688c33604b7.mp4?t=1759751379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware of haters \u2014 they\u2019ll try to throw you off, punish you, and drag you back down from the progress you\u2019ve fought so hard to achieve. Fortunately, your shotgun is not just for movement\u2026 It\u2019s also your tool for retaliation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision, strategy, and quick thinking will determine whether you rise or fall. Are you ready to face the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/8e8003bb46b3ef5a41749c811ed32f75.poster.avif?t=1759751379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/8e8003bb46b3ef5a41749c811ed32f75.webm?t=1759751379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036580/extras/8e8003bb46b3ef5a41749c811ed32f75.mp4?t=1759751379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/im